+# Password Hashing Policy
+
+The project's current recorded decision for password hashing is to use OpenSSL. The team selected it on the basis of team expertise and proven, battle-tested reliability, favoring operational continuity. The record names OpenSSL only; it does not specify a particular algorithm, cost parameters, or salt handling, so none are stated here.
